WEBVTT

00:00:11.670 --> 00:00:15.180
All right! I finally turned
into a decent bat.

00:00:15.180 --> 00:00:20.720
I'll show John and Ronaldo right awa--
Oh, yeah, they went shopping...

00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:24.350
John, I'll buy you some donuts!

00:00:24.350 --> 00:00:27.270
I guess I'll have to go find them, then.

00:00:34.950 --> 00:00:36.490
I'm so tired...

00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:47.040
All right! I could open
the window, at least.

00:00:47.040 --> 00:00:50.000
In this form, even everyday
movements are hard.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:53.260
Oh, well. To the outside world--

00:00:53.260 --> 00:00:54.880
Let's...!

00:02:31.100 --> 00:02:35.480
"The Bat's Close Call"

00:02:36.820 --> 00:02:39.070
My adventure's about to end here!

00:02:39.070 --> 00:02:42.490
Whoa! Why are all these
pigeons gathered here?

00:02:45.370 --> 00:02:48.750
Are you all right? Were you attacked?

00:02:48.750 --> 00:02:51.290
You saved me, Hinaichi--

00:02:51.290 --> 00:02:56.380
S-So cute! Oh, my! You're so cute!

00:02:56.380 --> 00:02:59.010
You're so calm.
Are you used to people?

00:02:59.010 --> 00:03:01.300
You're so cute!

00:03:01.300 --> 00:03:04.300
Wait, does she not realize it's me?

00:03:04.300 --> 00:03:07.020
Hmm, is this...

00:03:07.020 --> 00:03:09.100
Come on, it's time to eat.

00:03:09.100 --> 00:03:14.690
...my big chance to be fawned over
and also get some blood?

00:03:14.690 --> 00:03:18.150
Let's go together.
Come ride in here for a bit.

00:03:19.240 --> 00:03:24.530
Wow, you're so bold to put me
next to your chest, Hinaichi!

00:03:25.830 --> 00:03:30.330
When she starts walking, I have
to brace myself or I'll slide down!

00:03:30.330 --> 00:03:33.380
I shouldn't go any deeper
into a girl's clothes.

00:03:33.380 --> 00:03:35.500
It's not gentlemanly.

00:03:35.500 --> 00:03:37.210
We're almost there.

00:03:37.210 --> 00:03:41.630
Oh, I wonder what
Hinaichi's house is like...

00:03:43.090 --> 00:03:43.890
"Shin-Yokohama Police Station"

00:03:43.890 --> 00:03:47.760
"Shin-Yokohama Police Station"
Just in case, I'll have Handa
check if it's a vampire.

00:03:47.760 --> 00:03:51.310
No, no, please wait. Why do you have
to do your job properly right now?

00:03:51.310 --> 00:03:54.900
Where's the usual cookie monster?

00:03:54.900 --> 00:03:57.360
I mean, this is the position
we're in right now!

00:03:57.360 --> 00:03:59.610
"Vampire Control Division"

00:03:57.360 --> 00:03:59.610
If my identity is revealed right now,
she'll never talk to me again!

00:03:59.610 --> 00:04:00.900
If my identity is revealed right now,
she'll never talk to me again!

00:04:00.900 --> 00:04:03.700
Or rather, my body will definitely be made
into one she can never talk to again!

00:04:03.700 --> 00:04:06.990
Come on, don't struggle.
Handa will look at you right away--

00:04:06.990 --> 00:04:11.870
Oh, Vice-Captain! You have a pet?

00:04:11.870 --> 00:04:16.460
Sorry to ruin your good mood,
but that guy's not a normal bat!

00:04:17.460 --> 00:04:19.090
This guy's--

00:04:20.510 --> 00:04:26.140
Wait, Handa. It's me! Draluc!
I got lost! I can't let Hinaichi find out!

00:04:26.140 --> 00:04:28.100
Please gloss over this somehow!

00:04:28.100 --> 00:04:30.770
Hey, if it's not a normal bat,
then what is it?

00:04:30.770 --> 00:04:33.640
What's the matter?

00:04:33.640 --> 00:04:39.320
This guy's... um, uh... A crab.

00:04:39.320 --> 00:04:41.860
A crab?! He's obviously a bat!

00:04:41.860 --> 00:04:44.650
I-It's crab skilled at mimicry!

00:04:46.160 --> 00:04:50.160
"Kanagawa Prefectural Police
Vampire Control Division - Sagyo"
What are you saying? There's no way that's
a crab. Are you trying to trick her?

00:04:50.160 --> 00:04:52.700
There's no way I'd lie, Sagyo!

00:04:52.700 --> 00:04:56.040
My mom has always told me
that lying is bad!

00:04:56.040 --> 00:04:58.380
Sorry, Handa.
You're too terrible at lying.

00:04:58.380 --> 00:04:59.960
This is a crab!
Common name: Bat-like crab!

00:04:59.960 --> 00:05:01.880
"Infraorder: Anomura"
"Scientific name: Dokkaramitemo-Draluc"

00:04:59.960 --> 00:05:01.880
This is a crab!
Common name: Bat-like crab!

00:05:01.880 --> 00:05:03.210
"Infraorder: Anomura"
"Scientific name: Dokkaramitemo-Draluc"

00:05:01.880 --> 00:05:03.210
Normally found in the Kanto region!

00:05:03.210 --> 00:05:06.090
In the same family as the coconut crab,
it's technically a type of hermit crab,

00:05:06.090 --> 00:05:06.800
--but it's still a crab!

00:05:06.800 --> 00:05:08.220
--So stubborn!
--but it's still a crab!

00:05:08.220 --> 00:05:10.310
Is it really a crab,
even though it's so cute?

00:05:10.310 --> 00:05:12.020
Are you discriminating
against crabs, Vice-Captain?!

00:05:12.020 --> 00:05:13.850
What's wrong with a cute crab?

00:05:13.850 --> 00:05:17.100
No, it's not a matter of whether
it's cute or not! It's not a crab--

00:05:17.100 --> 00:05:19.360
If I say it's a crab, then it's a crab!

00:05:19.360 --> 00:05:21.190
Look carefully!

00:05:21.190 --> 00:05:22.980
C-Crab...!

00:05:22.980 --> 00:05:25.280
Crabs don't make that sound!

00:05:25.280 --> 00:05:27.450
I agree. Sorry.

00:05:27.450 --> 00:05:29.410
Idiot! They'll make whatever
sound they make!

00:05:29.410 --> 00:05:32.740
"Crab" is the sound they
make during courtship.

00:05:35.750 --> 00:05:37.830
C-Crab!

00:05:37.830 --> 00:05:41.460
A courtship display!
It looks like he likes you.

00:05:41.460 --> 00:05:43.510
What in the world am I doing?

00:05:43.510 --> 00:05:45.510
--Hey.
--Sand!

00:05:45.510 --> 00:05:47.550
Have you seen my fake mustache?

00:05:47.550 --> 00:05:49.680
Please don't come out
suddenly like that, Captain.

00:05:49.680 --> 00:05:51.930
You lost your mustache again?

00:05:51.930 --> 00:05:53.890
It doesn't look good on you, you know.

00:05:53.890 --> 00:05:56.310
Be quiet. What are you all doing?

00:05:56.310 --> 00:05:58.190
What are we doing...?

00:05:58.190 --> 00:05:59.440
Sand...

00:05:59.440 --> 00:06:02.690
Just now I saw something that
looked like ashes! That must be--

00:06:02.690 --> 00:06:04.610
Idiot! These are eggs!

00:06:04.610 --> 00:06:06.740
You made a move on it, so it laid eggs!

00:06:06.740 --> 00:06:08.110
You should take responsibility as a man!

00:06:08.110 --> 00:06:10.450
There's no way I'd make a move on a crab!

00:06:10.450 --> 00:06:13.790
Anyway, that's not a crab!

00:06:13.790 --> 00:06:16.450
The crab turned into something gross!

00:06:16.450 --> 00:06:18.460
My Little Snort--

00:06:18.460 --> 00:06:20.880
When did you give him
such a terrible name?

00:06:20.880 --> 00:06:23.210
It's because of that sound it was making.

00:06:26.550 --> 00:06:32.470
Fool! This is a crab!
It's a crab larva!

00:06:32.470 --> 00:06:33.100
"Egg"
It hatched from the eggs earlier!

00:06:33.100 --> 00:06:34.220
"Larva (Zoea)"
It hatched from the eggs earlier!

00:06:34.220 --> 00:06:34.560
"Larva (Megalopa)"
It hatched from the eggs earlier!

00:06:34.560 --> 00:06:35.180
"Larva (Megalopa)"
Stop talking about crabs!

00:06:35.180 --> 00:06:36.470
"Adult"
Stop talking about crabs!

00:06:36.680 --> 00:06:39.270
What about Little Snort?
What happened to him?

00:06:39.270 --> 00:06:42.900
It's... well... When crabs breed,
everything's passed on to one child,

00:06:42.900 --> 00:06:45.320
so once the child is born,
it's the parents' fate to die.

00:06:45.320 --> 00:06:48.820
You don't even know what you're
talking about yourself, do you?

00:06:48.820 --> 00:06:49.570
--Ga-goo!

00:06:49.570 --> 00:06:50.570
--Shut up!
--Ga-goo!

00:06:50.570 --> 00:06:54.580
What do you mean, "Shut up"?!
You're the one that created him! Admit it!

00:06:54.580 --> 00:06:56.580
You all need to cut it out!

00:06:56.580 --> 00:07:01.170
Stop teasing me! He looks harmless,
but he's a vampire, isn't he?

00:07:01.170 --> 00:07:03.000
You have to get him checked out.

00:07:03.000 --> 00:07:04.210
Yeah!

00:07:05.210 --> 00:07:06.840
I'll take care of it.

00:07:06.840 --> 00:07:09.510
Did you find your moustache?

00:07:09.510 --> 00:07:10.800
Yeah.

00:07:13.470 --> 00:07:18.390
What was that, anyway?
What were you hiding?

00:07:18.390 --> 00:07:21.600
Wait, he's got like a
developmental fever...

00:07:21.600 --> 00:07:25.520
You're Draluc from Hunter
Ronaldo's place, right?

00:07:25.520 --> 00:07:27.110
Y-Yes, I am!

00:07:27.110 --> 00:07:31.820
I knew it. Why were you pretending
to be a crab looking like that?

00:07:31.820 --> 00:07:34.530
I wonder...

00:07:34.530 --> 00:07:37.290
How did you know who I was?

00:07:37.290 --> 00:07:41.330
Because I know there's a strange vampire
at Ronaldo's who is bad at transforming,

00:07:41.330 --> 00:07:43.540
likes video games, and dies in no time!

00:07:43.540 --> 00:07:46.750
I read it in a book.

00:07:49.550 --> 00:07:51.720
Captain! I'll take Little Snort afte--

00:07:51.720 --> 00:07:53.260
Sand!

00:07:58.310 --> 00:07:59.850
Crab...

00:08:02.350 --> 00:08:04.190
"Super-Fast Ultra Mach Speed Delivery"
"Sand"
"COD"

00:08:02.350 --> 00:08:04.190
COD?!

00:08:04.190 --> 00:08:05.860
"Super-Fast Ultra Mach Speed Delivery"
"Sand"

00:08:04.190 --> 00:08:05.860
"COD"

00:08:08.150 --> 00:08:09.530
A lot happened...

00:08:09.530 --> 00:08:14.490
Oh, but first! I can turn into a bat now!

00:08:14.490 --> 00:08:16.830
Look, look! See?

00:08:17.740 --> 00:08:20.000
Here we go.

00:08:20.000 --> 00:08:22.250
Hey, look...

00:08:24.460 --> 00:08:26.630
