00:08:45.810 --> 00:08:47.730
Bye.

00:08:47.730 --> 00:08:49.110
Morning, John!

00:08:49.110 --> 00:08:50.480
"Shin-Yokohama Neighborhood
Futsal Tournament"

00:08:50.480 --> 00:08:51.110
"Shin-Yokohama Neighborhood
Futsal Tournament"
