you round thing?!

00:16:25.520 --> 00:16:29.280
Wh-What if those guys gather here?
You trying to get me killed?!

00:16:29.280 --> 00:16:32.030
Don't think you can get on my
good side with sweet rice jelly!

00:16:32.030 --> 00:16:34.780
Who's there? I heard
a voice over that way!

00:16:36.570 --> 00:16:41.250
Damn it, I can't believe I'm sneaking
around because of mere hunters.

00:16:41.250 --> 00:16:45.330
Be quiet! What does "nu"
even mean, anyway?!

00:16:45.330 --> 00:16:48.880
Wait, if this is such
an important armadillo,

00:16:48.880 --> 00:16:53.430
then I can use him as a hostage for
someone other than Ronaldo, too.

00:16:53.430 --> 00:16:56.850
I'll cut those who don't resist
to my heart's content...

00:16:56.850 --> 00:17:00.020
Hey! Where are you, kidnapper?!

00:17:00.020 --> 00:17:01.350
Was something there, Senya?!

00:17:01.350 --> 00:17:05.100
No. I thought I heard something, though...

00:17:05.100 --> 00:17:09.570
Jeez! I can't believe someone
would kidnap John and those kids!

00:17:09.570 --> 00:17:15.990
I'll break the balls...
of anyone that cowardly!

00:17:15.990 --> 00:17:19.240
B-Break balls...?

00:17:23.910 --> 00:17:26.210
D-Don't look at me like that.

00:17:26.210 --> 00:17:29.880
I'll slash you, armadillo.
Who do you think I am?

00:17:30.800 --> 00:17:33.340
I'm Tsujigiri Nagiri.
You don't know who I am?

00:17:33.340 --> 00:17:35.380
Then find out! Watch TV or something!

00:17:35.380 --> 00:17:38.090
Don't underestimate me!
The only problem is their numbers.

00:17:38.090 --> 00:17:39.390
I'll disappear into the crowd
and pick them off one by one--

00:17:39.390 --> 00:17:41.560
"Vamima!!!"

00:17:39.390 --> 00:17:41.560
I'll disappear into the crowd
and pick them off one by one--

00:17:41.560 --> 00:17:43.180
"Vamima!!!"

00:17:43.180 --> 00:17:46.600
Found him!
It's the kidnapper!

00:17:46.600 --> 00:17:50.440
Everyone, come here!
Someone suspicious has John!

00:17:54.530 --> 00:17:58.740
Damn it, I let my guard down.
At this rate, I'll be trapped like a rat.

00:17:58.740 --> 00:18:03.790
"Pride" "Safety"

00:17:58.740 --> 00:18:03.790
Since it's come to this... I'll leave
the armadillo somewhere and run away.

00:18:04.700 --> 00:18:07.120
Don't try to console me.

00:18:08.630 --> 00:18:11.420
I shouldn't have kidnapped
this round thing.

00:18:11.420 --> 00:18:16.220
Don't forget... The next time we meet--

00:18:16.220 --> 00:18:16.380
An inferior vampire!

00:18:16.380 --> 00:18:19.390
"Inferior Vampire - Hidden Spider Monster"

00:18:16.380 --> 00:18:19.390
An inferior vampire!

00:18:22.260 --> 00:18:25.930
Speaking of which, the searchers
said something weird...

00:18:25.930 --> 00:18:28.270
If this is the same as the kidnapper
in the missing children case,

00:18:28.270 --> 00:18:30.440
then they might be around here.

00:18:30.440 --> 00:18:33.150
Was that the child kidnapper?

00:18:33.150 --> 00:18:39.030
Good riddance, anyway.
If I just let things be--

00:18:39.030 --> 00:18:42.120
If I don't do anything, I won't
be able to return the armadillo,

00:18:42.120 --> 00:18:43.700
and I'll be trapped like a rat.

00:18:43.700 --> 00:18:48.710
Worst case, I'll even have the other
kidnappings pinned on me and be killed.

00:18:48.710 --> 00:18:52.920
Huh? It looks like
I'm in a terrible pinch.

00:19:47.220 --> 00:19:50.980
Found you, you worm!

00:19:53.100 --> 00:19:54.440
Die!

00:19:58.780 --> 00:20:01.490
Damn it, I can't believe

00:20:01.490 --> 00:20:06.790
that I, Tsujigiri Nagiri, acted like
a hunter in order to protect myself.

00:20:06.790 --> 00:20:08.240
Damn it!

00:20:10.410 --> 00:20:15.630
Listen! It was to deceive the hunters!
It wasn't to save you!

00:20:17.630 --> 00:20:23.340
If you tell anyone about this,
I'll turn you into mincemeat, armadillo!

00:20:23.340 --> 00:20:25.510
It looks like a suspicious
man came this way.

00:20:25.510 --> 00:20:27.260
It must be the culprit!

00:20:28.350 --> 00:20:30.560
They already sniffed me out?

00:20:31.940 --> 00:20:34.230
I'm not about to get caught...!

00:20:38.320 --> 00:20:41.280
What, armadillo? Let me go!

00:20:52.500 --> 00:20:55.330
John! John...!

00:20:57.130 --> 00:20:57.920
John...

00:20:57.920 --> 00:20:59.210
John!

00:20:59.210 --> 00:21:01.800
I'm sorry. It was scary, wasn't it?

00:21:14.440 --> 00:21:18.150
I see, you bought bean
jam pancakes for us.

00:21:19.070 --> 00:21:22.190
Huh? Only two?

00:21:22.190 --> 00:21:25.110
Too bad. Looks like there's
not enough for you, Ronaldo.

00:21:25.110 --> 00:21:29.370
John bought them for <i>me</i>!
Idiot! Right, John?

00:21:29.370 --> 00:21:32.290
It can't be helped.
I'll just give you the outside!

00:21:32.290 --> 00:21:33.870
Oh, thanks--

00:21:40.050 --> 00:21:43.090
Damn it, it's cold.

00:21:48.090 --> 00:21:50.850
"The barrier cannot be broken
until everything is lost."

00:21:55.730 --> 00:21:57.230
"Gain control"

00:21:58.190 --> 00:21:59.730
"Or die"

00:21:59.730 --> 00:22:02.650
Sleazebag! Open this!

00:22:04.610 --> 00:22:09.160
Damn it! Maria!

00:22:12.410 --> 00:22:15.790
The vampire dies in no time.
